{% doc %}
  Smoother same-site page navigation using native browser features only (no JavaScript, no router, no click
  interception). Shopify's normal multi-page navigation is unchanged; unsupported browsers ignore both parts.

  1. Cross-document View Transitions (@view-transition): a short cross-fade between same-origin pages. Off for
     prefers-reduced-motion and for the accessibility panel's "pause animations" mode (html[data-a11y-paused]).
     It never delays navigation: the browser skips the transition if the next page is slow.
  2. Speculation Rules prefetch, "moderate" eagerness (the browser prefetches a link after a short hover or on
     pointer down). Prefetch only, never prerender, so no page scripts or analytics run ahead of time. Only plain
     same-origin storefront pages qualify: cart, checkout, account, admin, apps, services, tools, search and
     password pages are excluded, as are links that open elsewhere, downloads, rel=nofollow and anything
     marked data-no-prefetch. Prefetched GET pages are never cart mutations.

  @example
  {% render 'page-navigation' %}
{% enddoc %}
<style>
  @view-transition { navigation: auto; }
  ::view-transition-old(root), ::view-transition-new(root) { animation-duration: 160ms; animation-timing-function: ease-out; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { @view-transition { navigation: none; } }
  html[data-a11y-paused]::view-transition-group(*),
  html[data-a11y-paused]::view-transition-old(*),
  html[data-a11y-paused]::view-transition-new(*) { animation: none !important; }
</style>
<script type="speculationrules" data-page-navigation>
  {
    "prefetch": [
      {
        "source": "document",
        "where": {
          "and": [
            { "href_matches": "/*" },
            { "not": { "href_matches": [
              "/cart", "/cart/*", "/cart?*", "/*/cart", "/*/cart/*", "/*/cart?*",
              "/checkout", "/checkout/*", "/checkout?*", "/checkouts/*", "/*/checkouts/*", "/*/checkout*",
              "/account", "/account/*", "/account?*", "/*/account", "/*/account/*",
              "/admin", "/admin/*", "/apps/*", "/*/apps/*", "/services/*", "/tools/*",
              "/search", "/search?*", "/*/search*", "/password", "/password?*", "/challenge*"
            ] } },
            { "not": { "selector_matches": "[target]:not([target=_self]), [download], [rel~=nofollow], [rel~=external], [data-no-prefetch], [href*='/cart/'], [href*='checkout']" } }
          ]
        },
        "eagerness": "moderate"
      }
    ]
  }
</script>
